# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, so without this a Windows
# checkout rewrites each checked-in text file to CRLF. Any test that compares
# generated output against a checked-in file byte for byte then fails on
# Windows only, although the generator and the file agree. The
# cortexkit-bus-naming permission golden did exactly that: 116 lines, every
# one differing only in its line ending.
#
# Pinning LF here, rather than normalising line endings inside each such test,
# keeps the comparison exact: a generator that started emitting CRLF would
# still fail.
* text=auto eol=lf
